  "id": "fig-16",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Preserve separate inputs and both head-to-tail orders with their equal resultants. Modern additions, not source givens: a top input band above two side-by-side construction panels, arbitrary regularized coordinates, English panel identifiers, 36 px ordinary Latin labels with explicitly mapped deterministic notation over-arrows instead of unsupported combining glyphs, single semantic resultant arrows in place of outlined scanned shafts, and small unlabelled visible ink endpoint markers explicitly authorized for this bounded modern candidate. Notation arrows are glyph geometry, not additional physical vectors or numerical givens. The source has no dot markers.",
